{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G2-01","example":{"issue":{"title":"市區號誌路口的轉向車道與行人號誌配置問題","intro":"主要道路寬約 20 m、次要道路寬約 14 m，現況速限均為 50 km/h。周邊以商業活動為主，轉向車流與行人穿越需求較高。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-01-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[117.792,0,3002.467,2474]},{"key":"results:g2-01-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-01-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-01-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-01-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"turn","title":"左、右轉車輛影響直行車流","text":"路口缺少適當的轉向車道，左轉車輛停等及右轉車輛減速時，容易阻礙後方直行車輛。"},{"id":"signal","title":"行人號誌未配合行穿線位置","text":"行人專用號誌常與行車管制號誌共桿，若未配合行穿線設置，行人在等待穿越時可能無法直接看見對應燈面。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限標誌與標字不足","text":"市區街廓較短，部分路段缺少速限標誌及路面標字，駕駛不易確認行駛路段的速限。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[50,51],"strategy":{"title":"左轉專用車道、路側停車及行人號誌配置","intro":"配合市區較高的轉向及行人穿越需求，配置左轉專用車道、調整路側停車空間，並檢核行車與行人號誌位置。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-01-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"lanes","title":"增設左轉專用車道及槽化設施","text":"於主要道路配置左轉專用車道，透過槽化線調整路口前後車道配置，減少左轉停等對直行車流的影響。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"parking","title":"依道路條件調整路側停車配置","text":"主要道路因街廓短、速限 50 km/h，本例採禁止路邊停車；次要道路將速限調整為 40 km/h，並配合人行道外擴設置嵌入式停車位。","moduleId":"M1-03"},{"id":"signals","title":"依行穿線位置配置行人號誌","text":"行人專用號誌應配合行穿線及行人停等位置設置，並檢核行車號誌的近、遠端燈面，確認各方向均能辨識對應號誌。","moduleId":"M2-03"},{"id":"turning","title":"配合左轉方式設置號誌燈面","text":"依左轉車流及衝突情形選擇機會左轉或保護左轉，分別配置對應的三燈式或四燈式號誌，並檢核號誌可視性。","moduleId":"M2-03"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-2-01-signalized-urban-orthogonal-t.typ","sha256":"f36b15319448c0fb73a03e61cf3a4ad4f34c2a6a8a3e2350576a664026ae2b70","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g2-01-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-01/G2-01_現況圖_01.png","width":3354,"height":2474,"label":"G2-01 現況圖","scenario":"G2-01","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":50,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image41.png","sha256":"6b84faf6ef590df33811b5210d036f1c783c9270f87d2692d8b7c788ea7a4ac2"},"results:g2-01-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-01/G2-01_現況照片_01.png","width":2580,"height":1434,"label":"G2-01 現況照片","scenario":"G2-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":51,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image42.png","sha256":"d5874adcb258bbc286bb83f5be450bfd3d4ebe918380833a91162d24712eca25"},"results:g2-01-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-01/G2-01_現況照片_02.png","width":2608,"height":1417,"label":"G2-01 現況照片 2","scenario":"G2-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":51,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image44.png","sha256":"9e20532e66eaaf7ef52752db2edba29c93e3dccca52238822d7b87a990a3a0f8"},"results:g2-01-photo-3":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-01/G2-01_現況照片_03.png","width":2583,"height":1456,"label":"G2-01 現況照片 3","scenario":"G2-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":51,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image43.png","sha256":"e5d083b19f16599245ec67809d1668433e31dbd0e266f525edd36003431f7d08"},"results:g2-01-photo-4":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-01/G2-01_現況照片_04.png","width":2436,"height":1321,"label":"G2-01 現況照片 4","scenario":"G2-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":51,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image45.png","sha256":"cf980b7da5d29b7bffd548106ad4f836d3577a7a54a9ef2816d7a694222965a5"},"results:g2-01-strategy":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/G2-01/G2-01_號誌化市區正交三叉路口交通設施整體設置圖例.svg","width":954,"height":963,"label":"G2-01 整體佈設圖","scenario":"G2-01","role":"strategy","sha256":"154ec10a1220f91eaa2c0520e68bcf26782f7332406cea6cd9d9d899c7f9668c"}}}
